    "media:imagetext": "SAS - Scandinavian Airlines System.-\nis the name for a combination of three\nfamous national airlines - those of\nDenmark, Norway and Sweden — who\nhave created a united world traffic and\nservice organisation.\nin the world ready to help you where-\never possible.\nOur already fine fleet has now been in-\ncreased by 17 of\nthe world's most modern aircraft,\nthe DC-6.\nFor you, the passenger,\nThis gives you added advantages for\nthe price of your ticket because the\nthis combine has great advantages, for\nby pooling our resources we now offer\nDC-6 means a faster journey in greater\ncomfort and repose.\nyou better service and more comfortable\nflights on an extended network of air-\nThe aim of the SAS organisation is to pro-\nlines. Moreover you will find our repre-\nvide the best possible service, speed and\nsentatives in most of the largest cities\ncomfort at a price within the reach of all.\nSCANDINAVIAN AIRLINES SYSTEM\nDanish - Norwegian - Swedish Air Lines\nScandinavian co-operation\nhas been established between the\nthree northern airlines so as to\ngive you, the travellers of the\nskyways, the best service and\ncomfort available in the most eco-\nnomical way.\nTo the farthest points\non earth in the fastest and\nmost comfortable way by\nScandinavian who has re.\npresentatives in the world's\nargest cines.\n* 199\nScandinavian service\nmeans perfect orga-\nnisation, good hu.\nmour, gallantry and\nhospitality.",
